WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:09.200
<v Dev Maheshwari>Hi, thanks for joining. I know this was a quick catch-up but I wanted to understand what you're planning for the quarter.</v>

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:21.400
<v Speaker>So Mistral Fitness is opening six new studios across Hyderabad and Chennai this quarter. We need a campaign that drives sign-ups for the launch, mostly on social.</v>

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:31.600
<v Dev Maheshwari>Understood. Who's the audience for this? Existing members or completely new people?</v>

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:42.800
<v Speaker>New members. Young professionals, twenty two to thirty five, tier one cities. The message is basically that fitness should fit your schedule, not the other way around.</v>

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:52.500
<v Dev Maheshwari>And tone-wise? Energetic, serious, something else?</v>

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:02.700
<v Speaker>Energetic and fun. We want it to feel light. The action we want is simple, book a free trial class.</v>

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:12.900
<v Dev Maheshwari>Got it. Is this social only or are we looking at the website too?</v>

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:22.100
<v Speaker>Social media mainly, and we'd want some video. Short form stuff for Instagram. Timeline is tight, we're targeting end of October.</v>

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:28.300
<v Dev Maheshwari>Noted. Let me write this up and come back to you with a proper scope.</v>
